        },
        {
          Label:"ask",
          Name:"Prove yourself",
          Priority:-1,
          Texts:[
            {
              Text:"Then prove yourself. Help the people of Lemurton first: the mayor's newcomers, the castle cook, Sir Vyvin's squire. Come back when they speak well of you."
            }
          ],
          Buttons:[
            {
              Label:"ask_0",
              Name:"They do. Give me a real challenge",
