          Name:"The Ender Dragon",
          Priority:-1,
          Texts:[
            {
              Text:"Very well. Under one of the old strongholds lies a portal to the End, and on its island lives the oldest dragon there is: the Ender Dragon. Many have tried to slay her. Oziach, who keeps the armoury on the ring street, came closest: ask him how it is done."
            }
          ],
          Buttons:[
